From 912087a974cce3a6ebbadd618e4e4b7d74ea5d1e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Floyd <git@notmy.space>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 22:15:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] extlinux: set prompt 0 so the menu does not block the boot

The generated extlinux.conf carries `menu title`, and U-Boot's parser
treats any menu directive as a request to prompt:

    case T_MENU:
            cfg->prompt = 1;

A prompting menu then ignores `timeout`. cread_line only honours its
timeout while nothing is waiting on stdin --

    while (!tstc()) {
            if (get_ticks() >= etime)
                    return -2;

-- so on a device whose stdin always has something pending the prompt is
entered immediately, an empty choice is read, " not found" is printed, and
menu_interactive_choice() sets m->timeout = 0 and blocks for ever.

Seen on a Motorola Moto G Play 2024: its buttons are on stdin and the PON
block latches volume-down in hardware, and its UART is left unclocked by the
previous stage, so both stdin sources report data. The handset has no
keyboard, so the prompt cannot be answered -- the only way out is fastboot.

Devices that do not feed stdin only pay a needless one second pause, which
is why this has gone unnoticed.

prompt 0 makes menu_get_choice() take menu_default_choice() directly, so the
default label boots without consulting stdin at all.

Signed-off-by: William Floyd <git@notmy.space>
---
 boot-deploy-functions.sh          | 1 +
 extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.1 | 1 +
 extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.2 | 1 +
 extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.3 | 1 +
 4 files changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/boot-deploy-functions.sh b/boot-deploy-functions.sh
index 675fb0d..f0d806b 100755
--- a/boot-deploy-functions.sh
+++ b/boot-deploy-functions.sh
@@ -1172,6 +1172,7 @@ create_extlinux_config() {
 timeout 1
 default $distro_name
 menu title boot prev kernel
+prompt 0
 
 label $distro_name
 	kernel /$kernel_filename
diff --git a/extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.1 b/extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.1
index 504c221..067a416 100644
--- a/extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.1
+++ b/extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.1
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 timeout 1
 default postmarketOS
 menu title boot prev kernel
+prompt 0
 
 label postmarketOS
 	kernel /vmlinuz
diff --git a/extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.2 b/extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.2
index 9aaf156..6a5b2f4 100644
--- a/extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.2
+++ b/extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.2
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 timeout 1
 default postmarketOS
 menu title boot prev kernel
+prompt 0
 
 label postmarketOS
 	kernel /vmlinuz
diff --git a/extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.3 b/extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.3
index 62e9b34..8b3fa36 100644
--- a/extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.3
+++ b/extlinux-examples/extlinux.conf.3
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 timeout 1
 default postmarketOS
 menu title boot prev kernel
+prompt 0
 
 label postmarketOS
 	kernel /vmlinuz
